---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Beaucoup Consulting handles information you send through this website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <section class="container page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="crumbs">Last updated: September 28, 2026</p>
  </section>
  <section class="container section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>This page explains what information {site.name} collects through this website and how it is used.</p>
      <h2>Information you send us</h2>
      <p>If you complete the contact form, we receive the details you enter: your name, email address, and optionally your company, position, and message. We use this information only to respond to your inquiry and to discuss potential work with you. We do not sell your information.</p>
      <h2>How the form works</h2>
      <p>Form submissions are delivered to us by email through a third-party form service (Web3Forms), which processes your submission on our behalf.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>This website does not use advertising cookies or tracking pixels. If we add privacy-friendly analytics in the future, we will update this page.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to delete or correct the information you sent us at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{site.name}<br />{site.phone}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
